%description:

Tests that Ieee8021adPolicy rejects a VLAN id outside 1 to 4094 in its ports
parameter at initialization, naming the interface. The network is the one of
lib/ieee8021ad-access-trunk.ini, with one malformed parameter.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
*.bridge1.bridging.vlanPolicy.ports = {"eth0" : {"type" : "access", "vid" : 4095}, "eth1" : {"type" : "access", "vid" : 10}, "eth2" : {"type" : "access", "vid" : 20}, "eth3" : {"type" : "trunk", "vids" : [10, 20]}}
include ../../lib/ieee8021ad-access-trunk.ini

%exitcode: 1
%postrun-command: grep '<!>' test.out test.err > vlan-port-error.out || true
%contains: vlan-port-error.out
Invalid VLAN id 4095 for interface 'eth0': expected 1 to 4094
